{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally in New York"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Playing the Stock Market"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Famous Structures > The Guggenheim Museum"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 13}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about directions to places in  a limited range of social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "broker "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who buys and sells shares"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Only brokers can work at the stock exchange."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear at the New York Stock Exchange."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "investor "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who puts an amount of money in a company to see it grow"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Brokers buy shares for the investors."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "member"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who is a part of an organization or group"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Each broker pays over a million dollars to become a member."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "trading floor"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the area where brokers work"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Brokers run across the trading floor."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to shout "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to speak very loudly"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Brokers shout orders to buy and sell shares."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "monitor "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "computer screen; display"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The monitors give information about the stocks."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le13ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Expressing Uncertainty"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You express uncertainty when you are not sure whether something can happen, or whether something is true or not.You can use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">Hang on\u2026, </span>or <span class=\"italic\">I don't understand</span> to show uncertainty. You use the <span class =\"strong\">Simple Present</span> tense to express uncertainty."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Expressions </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Meaning </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Hang on...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You need a moment to think about it.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I don't understand...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You need more information.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I'm not sure...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You don't think you know or agree.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I suppose...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You may know or agree, but are not sure about it.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of an unusual job. What kind of job is it?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Go online and find information about people who have that job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a paragraph (5-8 lines) about their daily routine."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say if you would you like to have their job. "}, {"type": "text", "content": " Listen to your partner's job description. Is it similar? Different?"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research online about unusual jobs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about daily work routines."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express uncertainty."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I listen to a job description and make comparisons."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 3, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le13ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le13ob07re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn4le13ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Who can buy and sell shares?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Broker</span>: Not everyone can trade on the stock exchange. Only brokers can do this. They buy and sell shares of stock for other people, the investors. Each broker pays over a million dollars to be a member.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn4le13ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hang on ...  All the people around here?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Broker</span>: Yes. All the trading takes place in front of you. Hundreds of people run across the floor, talking, checking the latest stock prices and shouting orders.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Is that why they look so busy?", "id": 2, "time": "15000", "image": "engenn4le13ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Broker</span>: Pretty much, yeah. They're busy buying and selling on the trading floor.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Why are there so many computer screens? I don't understand ...<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Broker</span>: The monitors give information about the stocks. They show how much they cost.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm not sure I can remember all this. I suppose I wouldn't want to work here!", "id": 3, "time": "30000", "image": "engenn4le13ob07re2img02.jpg"}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "h